<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>notif.cards.body %lld</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ຫຼິ້ນ %lld ນາທີມື້ນີ້ ແລ້ວເກັບເພີ່ມອີກ.</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ຫຼິ້ນ %lld ນາທີມື້ນີ້ ແລ້ວເກັບເພີ່ມອີກ.</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>notif.day3.body %lld</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ເລີ່ມການຫຼິ້ນ %lld ນາທີ ແລະຂະຫຍາຍການຫຼິ້ນປະຈໍາວັນຂອງທ່ານ.</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ເລີ່ມການຫຼິ້ນ %lld ນາທີ ແລະຂະຫຍາຍການຫຼິ້ນປະຈໍາວັນຂອງທ່ານ.</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>notif.streak.body %lld</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ຫຼິ້ນເປັນເວລາ %lld ນາທີ ແລະສືບຕໍ່ການຫຼິ້ນປະຈຳວັນຂອງເຈົ້າຕໍ່ໄປ!</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ຫຼິ້ນເປັນເວລາ %lld ນາທີ ແລະສືບຕໍ່ການຫຼິ້ນປະຈຳວັນຂອງເຈົ້າຕໍ່ໄປ!</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>notif.streak.title %lld</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ສະຖິຕິການຫຼິ້ນປະຈໍາວັນຂອງເຈົ້າຮອດ %lld ມື້ແລ້ວ! 🔥</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ສະຖິຕິການຫຼິ້ນປະຈໍາວັນຂອງເຈົ້າຮອດ %lld ມື້ແລ້ວ! 🔥</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>parentGate.holdInstruction %@ %lld</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%2$#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ກົດ %1$@ ຄ້າງ %2$lld ວິນາທີ.</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ກົດ %1$@ ຄ້າງ %2$lld ວິນາທີ.</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>parentGate.tapInstruction %lld %@</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSStringLocalizedFormatKey</key>
		<string>%#@value@</string>
		<key>value</key>
		<dict>
			<key>NSStringFormatSpecTypeKey</key>
			<string>NSStringPluralRuleType</string>
			<key>NSStringFormatValueTypeKey</key>
			<string>lld</string>
			<key>one</key>
			<string>ຕອນນີ້ແຕະ %2$@ %1$lld ຄັ້ງ.</string>
			<key>other</key>
			<string>ຕອນນີ້ແຕະ %2$@ %1$lld ຄັ້ງ.</string>
		</dict>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
